cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use gMAS in research, please cite this software and the relevant release.
type: software
title: "gMAS: Dynamic graph-based multi-agent systems"
abstract: >-
  gMAS is an open-source Python framework for building, executing, adapting,
  and observing graph-based multi-agent systems with large language models.
